### Record Grade (teacher or admin)
POST http://localhost:3600/api/grades
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

{
  "student_id": 1,
  "subject_id": 1,
  "class_id": 1,
  "grade": 87.5,
  "term": "Term 1"
}

###

### Record Another Grade
POST http://localhost:3600/api/grades
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

{
  "student_id": 4,
  "subject_id": 1,
  "class_id": 1,
  "grade": 92.0,
  "term": "Term 1"
}

###

### Update Existing Grade (same student/subject/class/term — overwrites)
POST http://localhost:3600/api/grades
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

{
  "student_id": 1,
  "subject_id": 1,
  "class_id": 1,
  "grade": 91.0,
  "term": "Term 1"
}

###

### Get All Grades
GET http://localhost:3600/api/grades
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

###

### Filter by Student
GET http://localhost:3600/api/grades?student_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

###

### Filter by Term
GET http://localhost:3600/api/grades?term=Term 1
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}